//! dscu-driver-v1 wire contract (NDJSON, one JSON object per line).
//!
//! Accepts all three dialects emitted by the v7.1 PowerShell client with ZERO client changes:
//!  1. `Invoke-DriverRpc`      {"jsonrpc":"2.0","v":1,"action_id":N,"id":N,"method":"..","params":{..},"auth":".."}
//!  2. `New-IpcEnvelope`       {"v":1,"id":N,"method":"..","params":{..},"ts":ms,"action_id":N}
//!  3. `TryCallNamedPipe`      {"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":N,"method":"..","params":{..}}   (legacy, no v / no auth)
