"""Layer-0 Native Safe File primitives: deterministic, GUI-free, policy-checked, read-back verified.

"新建记事本，输入X，命名为Y，保存在桌面" is a pure file task.  v10 spent 60 GUI steps on it; here it is
parse -> save_text (atomic, verified) -> open in Notepad (cosmetic) -> done  = 3 steps, 0 LLM tokens.
