# dscu-workspace v11.0 (Phase 10) — unified Agent brain monorepo

One brain, five layers, one protocol (`schemas/protocol.v1.json`).

| path | language | role |
|---|---|---|
| `schemas/protocol.v1.json` | JSON Schema | ObservationEnvelope / ActionRequest / ActionResult / SpanTelemetry — single source of truth |
| `agent_brain/` | Python ≥3.10 (asyncio, stdlib only) | router (L0–L4 + breakers), security (Intent-Scoped Path Grant), state_machine (Self-Drawn escape ladder, Quota-Zero finalizer, epoch), native_files (Layer-0), memory/checkpoint (resume + rollback), core (control loop), executors/transport |
| `crates/dscu-driver/` | Rust (windows-rs 0.58) | DXGI duplication → DsV9Ring, `@snapshot:ref`, SendInput (US symbol map), JobObject KILL_ON_JOB_CLOSE, idempotent `act` + `expect_epoch` over `\\.\pipe\dscu-driver-v1` |
| `packages/cdp-daemon/` | TypeScript (node ≥22.6) | CDP daemon, `[Zone: Toolbar/Row]`, `snapshot_epoch` lock (`DOM.resolveNode` can no longer leak), idempotent ledger |
| `workers/ps_safe_worker.ps1` | PowerShell 7 | AST whitelist + CLM executor only (no main loop) |
| `evals/` | Python | WAA-style arena: 3 log regressions, 8 red-team cases, honest perf gates (`SKIP` ≠ `PASS`) |

```powershell
pwsh -File scripts/up.ps1            # build + test + start planes
python tests/test_v11.py             # contracts, security, state machine, router, checkpoint
python evals/run.py                  # 3 regressions + red team + perf gates
python -m agent_brain run "新建一个记事本，输入梁梓斌，命名为毕祖铭，保存在桌面"
```
