Layer 0: CLI-Anything / Native Safe File (`--json` + magic number verification)
Layer 1: TS CDP Daemon (async CDP with `snapshot_epoch` lock + `Zone: Toolbar|Row`)
Layer 2: Rust UIA/JAB Headless Ref (`@s<epoch>:e<id>` + `--skeleton` + `uiAccess="true"`)
