"""24GB UMA hysteresis breaker (kept bit-compatible with PowerShell `Test-UmaMemoryHealth`): trip below 4096 MB available,
recover only above 4096 + 768 MB (+0.75 GB) -> no flapping.  While tripped: local vision sidecar MUST be unloaded and
